<resources>
    <string name="ds_about_badge">UNOFFICIAL · UNOFFICIAL</string>
    <string name="ds_about_cost_body">This app is free; it does not sell keys or top-ups. DeepSeek bills API usage directly to your account balance. Web search and link reading also incur official charges. Top up on the DeepSeek platform if your balance is low.</string>
    <string name="ds_about_cost_title">Cost</string>
    <string name="ds_about_data_body">Conversations, messages, settings and the API key are stored only on this phone. System backup and device-to-device transfer are disabled for this app. We do not run an account server or a cloud database. Messages are sent directly to api.deepseek.com when you chat; that is unavoidable when using the API. To switch phones, export your conversations to a ZIP on the old device and import it on the new one. Uninstalling the app or clearing app data will permanently lose local conversations.</string>
    <string name="ds_about_data_title">Where your data lives</string>
    <string name="ds_about_headline">This is not DeepSeek\'s official app.</string>
    <string name="ds_about_intro">Read this page before deciding to use it.</string>
    <string name="ds_about_license_body">This project is based on the open-source GPT Mobile project. Upstream uses GPL-3.0, so this project is released under GNU GPL-3.0, not MIT. You may view, modify and distribute the code under GPL-3.0; redistributed modified versions must keep the same license and source availability.</string>
    <string name="ds_about_license_title">Open source &amp; license</string>
    <string name="ds_about_risk_body">AI output may be wrong; verify it and do not treat it as medical, legal or financial advice. Do not use the app for illegal activity. You are responsible for losses caused by your usage, a leaked API key, or account restrictions. Never share your API key.</string>
    <string name="ds_about_risk_title">Risks you accept</string>
    <string name="ds_about_title">About</string>
    <string name="ds_about_unlimited_body">It means this app imposes no message count, duration, edit count or retention limit. It does not mean the API is free or has unlimited tokens, nor does it override DeepSeek\'s balance, rate limits, risk controls or account policies.</string>
    <string name="ds_about_unlimited_title">What “unlimited” means</string>
    <string name="ds_about_version">DeepSeek Unlimited v%1$s · unofficial client</string>
    <string name="ds_about_view_license">View GPL-3.0 license</string>
    <string name="ds_about_who_body">DeepSeek Unlimited is a third-party open-source client. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or authorized by DeepSeek or Hangzhou DeepSeek Artificial Intelligence Basic Technology Research Co., Ltd. “DeepSeek” is a trademark of its owner and is used here only to describe the connected API service. The whale artwork in the app is a placeholder; no official asset is included.</string>
